eight:28px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-scent-title{font-size:22px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-module{padding:18px 16px;margin:22px 0 10px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-product{font-size:19px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-sub{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:14px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-image{aspect-ratio:4/3;max-height:240px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-card{padding:12px 14px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-card ul{font-size:13.5px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-review-desc{font-size:15px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-dek{font-size:17px;margin:18px 0 22px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-summary{font-size:17px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-container{padding:0 24px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-article{padding:24px 0 50px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-cta{font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-rule{margin:26px 0;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-bundle{padding:36px 24px 48px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-bundle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-bundle-title{font-size:22px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-price-now{font-size:24px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-price-discount{font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-bundle-cta{font-size:15px;padding:16px 20px;}\n}\n@media (max-width:380px){\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-hero-title-band h1{font-size:22px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-byline{font-size:12px;}\n  .tryscent-listicle .ts-byline-sep{display:none;}\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"tryscent-listicle\">\n\n  <header class=\"ts-pub-header\">\n    <p class=\"ts-pub-eyebrow\">Advertisement</p>\n    <div class=\"ts-pub-logo\">The Style Guide</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <picture class=\"ts-hero-image\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 540px)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/hero-mobile.png?v=1779478466\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/hero-desktop.png?v=1779478467\" alt=\"TryScent men's fragrances for summer\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n  </picture>\n\n  <section class=\"ts-hero-title-band\">\n    <h1>5 Men's Fragrances for Summer That Get More Compliments Than a 1,400 kr Bottle</h1>\n    <div class=\"ts-byline\">\n      <span class=\"ts-byline-avatar\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/author-avatar.png?v=1779478470\" alt=\"Erik Lundqvist\"></span>\n      <span>by Erik Lundqvist</span>\n      <span class=\"ts-byline-sep\">·</span>\n      <span>15 jul 2025</span>\n      <span class=\"ts-byline-sep\">·</span>\n      <span>4 min read</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <article class=\"ts-container ts-article\">\n\n    <p class=\"ts-dek\">These aren't random copies. They're perfumes with 21% extrait-level concentration, tested against the designer original. And they last over 12 hours.</p>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <p>There's a dirty secret in the perfume world: most designer perfumes fade in 2 to 3 hours. You spray, leave the house, and by lunch you're wearing basically nothing. The bottle cost 1,400 kr. The result? You're invisible.</p>\n\n    <p>Here's what smart men have figured out: you can pay 10 times less for exactly the same scent and make it last over 12 hours. These are the five biggest men's fragrances of summer 2025. And the smarter alternative to each one.</p>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <!-- SCENT 1 -->\n    <section class=\"ts-scent\">\n      <h2 class=\"ts-scent-title\"><span class=\"ts-num\">1.</span>Dior Sauvage Eau de Parfum</h2>\n\n      <p>Sauvage opens with icy Calabrian bergamot and black pepper. That sharp, cold-shower-on-a-mountain-in-the-morning impression that made it the world's best-selling men's cologne. Then warm ambroxan rolls in, close to the skin and magnetic.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-review-module\">\n        <p class=\"ts-review-label\">Best alternative</p>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-review-product\">Bergamot Pepper Ambroxan</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-sub\">For men who own the room.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-grid\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/dior-sauvage.webp?v=1779478462\" alt=\"Bergamot Pepper Ambroxan\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-buy\">\n            <div class=\"ts-review-price-old\">\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-amount\">1,400 kr</span>\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-label\">Designer price</span>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#ts-bundle-anchor\" class=\"ts-cta\">See Bundle — Save 55%</a>\n            <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/bergamot-pepper-ambroxan\" class=\"ts-review-product-link\">Buy this scent only</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-credit\">Photo: TryScent</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-cards\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>How you come across</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Confident, direct and physically present</li>\n              <li>The man wearing it doesn't need to announce himself</li>\n              <li>People read him first, ask questions later</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>Best for</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Everyday wear, the office, first dates</li>\n              <li>Outdoor events in summer</li>\n              <li>Meeting room or rooftop bar — works everywhere</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"ts-review-desc\">Bergamot Pepper Ambroxan opens the same way as the original. Crackling bergamot and pepper, then it settles onto the same warm, clean ambroxan base that makes people lean in toward you. At 21% concentration it stays on your skin through the heat, the commute and the evening.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <!-- SCENT 2 -->\n    <section class=\"ts-scent\">\n      <h2 class=\"ts-scent-title\"><span class=\"ts-num\">2.</span>Acqua di Gio Eau de Parfum</h2>\n\n      <p>Acqua di Gio has been the scent of summer for thirty years. Sea spray. Mediterranean air. The cool, clean impression of aquatic bergamot and marine freshness, then cedarwood that anchors it all in something that smells expensive and effortlessly masculine.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-review-module\">\n        <p class=\"ts-review-label\">Best alternative</p>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-review-product\">Magic Perfume Nr. 221</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-sub\">For men who don't need to prove anything.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-grid\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/acqua-di-gio.webp?v=1779478462\" alt=\"Magic Perfume Nr. 221\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-buy\">\n            <div class=\"ts-review-price-old\">\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-amount\">1,100 kr</span>\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-label\">Designer price</span>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#ts-bundle-anchor\" class=\"ts-cta\">See Bundle — Save 55%</a>\n            <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/magic-perfume-no-221m\" class=\"ts-review-product-link\">Buy this scent only</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-credit\">Photo: TryScent</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-cards\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>How you come across</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Clean, approachable and quietly well-groomed</li>\n              <li>Someone whose life is in order — without needing to prove it</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>Best for</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Relaxed daytime, beach days, outdoor lunches</li>\n              <li>Social weekend activities where the mood is easy</li>\n              <li>When you still want to make an impression</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"ts-review-desc\">Magic Perfume No. 221 opens with bergamot and fresh sage. The same instant flash of cool, coastal air on warm skin. The cedarwood base is clean and polished without turning sharp. In the summer heat at 21% concentration it doesn't collapse into a skin scent by hour three. It projects. All day.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <!-- SCENT 3 -->\n    <section class=\"ts-scent\">\n      <h2 class=\"ts-scent-title\"><span class=\"ts-num\">3.</span>Bleu de Chanel Eau de Parfum</h2>\n\n      <p>Bleu de Chanel is what people mean when they say 'expensive clean.' Grapefruit and lemon on the opening, slightly metallic and fresh. Then a heart of ginger, nutmeg and incense with real depth. The cedarwood base is polished and warm. Works at 7 in the morning. Works at 11 at night. Chanel knows this, which is why they keep it at 1,500 kr and never discount it.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-review-module\">\n        <p class=\"ts-review-label\">Best alternative</p>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-review-product\">Magic Perfume Nr. 252</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-sub\">For men with taste and zero need to show it.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-grid\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/bleu-de-chanel.webp?v=1779478462\" alt=\"Magic Perfume Nr. 252\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-buy\">\n            <div class=\"ts-review-price-old\">\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-amount\">1,500 kr</span>\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-label\">Designer price</span>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#ts-bundle-anchor\" class=\"ts-cta\">See Bundle — Save 55%</a>\n            <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/magic-perfume-no-252m\" class=\"ts-review-product-link\">Buy this scent only</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-credit\">Photo: TryScent</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-cards\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>How you come across</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Sophisticated and dependable</li>\n              <li>Someone with taste and self-discipline</li>\n              <li>Not flashy, not trying too hard — just genuinely well-groomed</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>Best for</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>The office, business meetings, dinners with clients</li>\n              <li>Smart evenings out</li>\n              <li>Morning meeting to evening dinner — without missing a step</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"ts-review-desc\">Magic Perfume No. 252 gives you the same citrus-woody elegance. Clean opening, aromatic heart, warm dry-down. The perfume that makes you smell effortlessly well-dressed without the bill.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <!-- SCENT 4 -->\n    <section class=\"ts-scent\">\n      <h2 class=\"ts-scent-title\"><span class=\"ts-num\">4.</span>Creed Aventus Eau de Parfum</h2>\n\n      <p>Aventus is the holy grail. Pineapple, blackcurrant and bergamot burst open bright and fruity. A combination that shouldn't work but absolutely does. Then comes birch and patchouli with real smokiness. Then oakmoss: rich, complex, unmistakably powerful. It's the perfume that stops strangers mid-sentence. It costs 4,000 kr.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-review-module\">\n        <p class=\"ts-review-label\">Best alternative</p>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-review-product\">Pineapple Smoke Vanilla</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-sub\">For men who run the room.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-grid\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/aventus.png?v=1779478466\" alt=\"Pineapple Smoke Vanilla\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-buy\">\n            <div class=\"ts-review-price-old\">\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-amount\">4,000 kr</span>\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-label\">Designer price</span>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#ts-bundle-anchor\" class=\"ts-cta\">See Bundle — Save 55%</a>\n            <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/pineapple-smoke-vanilla-50-ml-1-7-fl-oz\" class=\"ts-review-product-link\">Buy this scent only</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-credit\">Photo: TryScent</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-cards\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>How you come across</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Powerful, successful and impossible to ignore</li>\n              <li>The man who walks into a room and changes the energy</li>\n              <li>People remember you after you've left</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>Best for</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Evening events and special occasions</li>\n              <li>Dates where you want to make an impression</li>\n              <li>Networking events — when it matters to be memorable</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"ts-review-desc\">Pineapple Smoke Vanilla takes the warm, spicy-woody architecture and runs with it. Rich and spiced on the opening, clean and masculine through the dry-down, with the projection and longevity that extrait level truly delivers. Aventus' compliment-magnet DNA.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <!-- SCENT 5 -->\n    <section class=\"ts-scent\">\n      <h2 class=\"ts-scent-title\"><span class=\"ts-num\">5.</span>YSL Y Eau de Parfum</h2>\n\n      <p>YSL Y is the modern everyday driver. Apple, ginger and bergamot opening. Fresh, clean, slightly sweet. The sage and juniper heart is crisp. The tonka bean base adds warmth without going heavy in summer. It's the cologne you spray without thinking and somehow everyone comments on it all day.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-review-module\">\n        <p class=\"ts-review-label\">Best alternative</p>\n        <h3 class=\"ts-review-product\">Lavender Mint (No. 034)</h3>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-sub\">For men who attract without trying.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-grid\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ysl-y-edp.png?v=1779478466\" alt=\"Lavender Mint (No. 034)\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-buy\">\n            <div class=\"ts-review-price-old\">\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-amount\">1,200 kr</span>\n              <span class=\"ts-review-price-label\">Designer price</span>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#ts-bundle-anchor\" class=\"ts-cta\">See Bundle — Save 55%</a>\n            <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/bergamot-sage-cedar-50-ml\" class=\"ts-review-product-link\">Buy this scent only</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ts-review-credit\">Photo: TryScent</p>\n\n        <div class=\"ts-review-cards\">\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>How you come across</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Relaxed, likeable and naturally attractive</li>\n              <li>Doesn't seem to be trying to impress — which is exactly why he impresses everyone</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ts-review-card\">\n            <h4>Best for</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Everyday wear all day, gym-to-lunch</li>\n              <li>Casual hangouts and summer festivals</li>\n              <li>When you want to smell good without overthinking it</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"ts-review-desc\">Lavender Mint opens with cool lavender and mint. That flash of cold green on warm skin is like the first sip of something ice-cold on a hot afternoon. The vanilla finish is soft and clean. At 21% concentration it lasts the whole workday, the commute and into the evening.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <hr class=\"ts-rule\">\n\n    <!-- SUMMARY + FINAL CTA -->\n    <p class=\"ts-summary\"><strong>The math is simple.</strong> Five designer originals would cost you over 9,000 kr. Five TryScentCo scents cost 634.95 kr with higher oil concentration, longer longevity and scent profiles built to match the originals note for note.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"ts-cta-wrap\" style=\"margin-top:36px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/5-x-100ml-perfume-bottles\" class=\"ts-cta\">Try them at TryScent.co</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <section class=\"ts-bundle\" id=\"ts-bundle-anchor\">\n    <div class=\"ts-bundle-inner\">\n      <div class=\"ts-bundle-header\">\n        <div class=\"ts-bundle-tags\">\n          <span class=\"ts-tag-red\">55% Off</span>\n          <span class=\"ts-tag-dark\">Bestseller</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"ts-bundle-title\">The Men's Summer Fragrance Wardrobe — For Every Occasion</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-bundle-grid\">\n        <div class=\"ts-bundle-image\">\n          <img src=\"https://tryscent.co/cdn/shop/files/5bottlesswedish2026.png?v=1767668462\" alt=\"TryScent 5-bottle bundle\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-bundle-copy\">\n          <p class=\"ts-bundle-designer\">(Designer price: 7,402.20 kr)</p>\n          <span class=\"ts-eu-pill\">🇪🇺 Made in the EU</span>\n          <p class=\"ts-bundle-desc\">A scent for every mood = never get bored. Plus each 30 ml bottle lasts 2–4 months with daily use. So that's over a year of smelling amazing.</p>\n          <div class=\"ts-bundle-price\">\n            <span class=\"ts-price-old\">1,301.00 kr</span>\n            <span class=\"ts-price-now\">586.00 kr</span>\n            <span class=\"ts-price-discount\">−55%</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"ts-bundle-perflask\">Only 117.20 kr per bottle</p>\n          <p class=\"ts-bundle-notes\"><strong>Top notes:</strong> Pineapple · Bergamot · Blackcurrant</p>\n          <ul class=\"ts-bundle-bullets\">\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg> Up to 21% EDP concentration</li>\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg> 12+ hours of longevity</li>\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg> EU-made · IFRA-certified</li>\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg> Clean Label cosmetics</li>\n            <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg> Vegan · Cruelty-free</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"https://tryscent.co/sv-se/products/5-x-100ml-perfume-bottles\" class=\"ts-cta ts-bundle-cta\">Find Your Scents — Buy The Bundle 586 kr</a>\n          <p class=\"ts-bundle-sub\">Free shipping over 483 kr · 60-day open purchase · Easy returns</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>",
